	(text "USB\nFit USB301 (on board) or J301 + an off-board USB-C receptacle, not both. J301 carries\nVBUS, D-, D+, CC1, CC2, GND: the off-board part is a bare connector (our usb/ board or any\nbreakout). R301/R302 (5.1k) and U301 (ESD) here serve both; leave R301/R302 off if the\nbreakout already has its own 5.1k.\nCH340C runs from its own XC6206 (3.3 V from VBUS): no battery drain without USB.\nV3 tied to VCC (3.3 V supply); R232 low; CTS/DSR/RI/DCD unused (internal pull-ups).\nTX/RX through 470R. Auto-reset: DTR/RTS both low or both high = idle; the usual\nesptool sequence pulls EN or IO0 low (GPIO0 is also the codec's MCLK, as on the Audio Kit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8334c080-5480-4cbc-8446-d07c22c32fce")
	)
